# Async Patterns

- Prefer `async/await` with explicit error handling; no silent fire-and-forget.
- Use `Promise.all` vs `allSettled` deliberately; prefer `AbortController` for cancellation.
- UI states: `idle | loading | success | error`; prevent double-submit; provide retry; avoid late responses overwriting newer UI.
- Timeouts/retries only when idempotent; don’t empty-catch; don’t block UI with huge sync work.

